ess_file receives the request, form data, verified user, and database session.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9a33713dbcb5163f","startLine":1546,"endLine":1552}]},{"id":"f-source-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin, the source file is fetched using the supplied file ID together with user.id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9a33713dbcb5163f","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The destination collection is taken from form_data.collection_name and is defaulted only if that value is absent.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9a33713dbcb5163f","startLine":1564,"endLine":1569}]},{"id":"f-authorization-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible authorization-related control is the non-admin source-file lookup by file ID and user ID; the supplied source does not show a destination ownership or explicit write-grant check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9a33713dbcb5163f","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]},{"id":"f-content-selection","kind":"condition","statement":"When collection_name is supplied without form_data.content, documents are built from the existing file content or from content previously queried for the file collection.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9a33713dbcb5163f","startLine":1596,"endLine":1626}]},{"id":"f-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The constructed documents are passed to save_docs_to_vector_db with the selected collection_name and add=True, which is the destination write call in the supplied path.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9a33713dbcb5163f","startLine":1694,"endLine":1707}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":4500,"output":972,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":57891.38679999998,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T07:49:37.017Z"}}
